# Testing and CI

Composer scripts, container execution, tool-config locations under
`tests/`, the before-PR checklist, and CI matrix details live in
**[docs/testing.md](../../docs/testing.md)**. Follow that document.

Remember: **`composer` and `php` are container-only**; do not assume they
exist on the host PATH.
